  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Are you okay?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "'Cause you're the one who needed space",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And finally, now I'm doing fine",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "You would rather see me cry",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Are you okay?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You're acting like we never changed",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And finally, I can sleep at night",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Makes you wanna lose your mind",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "(Are you okay?)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I know that you've been scared of love",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "And everything it did to us",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But how am I supposed to open up",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "When you were just so good at closing off?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "You're up and down, I'm inside out",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You ripped my heart right from my mouth",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And then I had to go and pick it up",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "And play it like I didn't give a fuck",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You called up my phone fifty times from that party",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "3 a.m., you thought I'd be there in a heartbeat",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Your life but you might wanna put down the Bacardi",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Mean this sincerely, dude",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
